  "productDetails": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "把游戏屋做成工程巴士",
        "en": "A bus-shaped play space"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/2060A/b3bd13eb7f63.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "帐篷以工程巴士为主题，车身图案与车窗位置让外观像一辆小巴士。可以围绕司机、乘客或出发旅行安排角色游戏，顶棚开口也能在图片中看到。",
        "en": "The construction bus theme uses vehicle graphics and window shapes to form a small bus-like tent. Players can make up driver, passenger or travel games. The images also show openings in the roof."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "130 × 75 × 75 cm的布艺空间",
        "en": "130 × 75 × 75 cm fabric tent"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/2060A/ce75550f92dc.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "商品尺寸130 × 75 × 75 cm，采用布艺帐篷结构。摆放前先量好位置，除帐篷占地外，也给进出位置留出空间。",
        "en": "The fabric tent measures 130 × 75 × 75 cm. Measure the intended position before setting it up and leave room around the entrance as well as for the tent itself."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "100个彩球一起配套",
        "en": "100 colored balls"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/2060A/f184684fc0f9.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "包装注明随附100个彩球，可以放入帐篷组织球池游戏，也可以单独安排找颜色、取放球的活动。结束后先把彩球收齐，再整理帐篷。",
        "en": "The package lists 100 colored balls. Use them in the tent for ball-pit play or separately for color-sorting and collecting games. Gather the balls before putting the tent away."
      }
    }
  ],
